---
description: Fuse UI system
globs: apps/dashboard/**
alwaysApply: true
---

Build a serious AI operations control room, not a generic admin template. Use
Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Radix primitives, Motion for deliberate transitions, Lucide
icons, Recharts, and TanStack Query.

Palette: background #0B0D12, panels #121722, text #F4F1EA, muted #8D96A8, active
#55D6FF, running #FFB84D, completed #63E6BE, breaker #FF6B6B.

Use Space Grotesk or Sora for headings, Inter or IBM Plex Sans for body text, and
JetBrains Mono for IDs and event data. Make status, policy, reason, and blocked-call
evidence visible. Respect keyboard focus and reduced-motion preferences.

The landing page is an invitation; the dashboard is the product proof. Do not
hard-code live counters. Breaker copy must say “Next invocation blocked.”
